 yprus\; up to EUR 1\,250 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:Kimonos Art Center's Episkeptes residency hosts three internati
 onal visual artists\, including video and multimedia artists\, for one mon
 th\, ending with a public presentation. ELIGIBILITY: international visual 
 artists. OFFER: up to EUR 1\,250 stipend and up to EUR 250 travel. APPLY v
 ia the open call page (EUR 25 fee)\; results 30 November 2026. DEADLINE: 1
 6 November 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Kimonos Art Center\nLocation: Lemba\, Pa
 phos\, Cyprus. In person.\nAward: Up to EUR 1\,250 stipend plus up to EUR 
 250 travel. EUR 25 application fee.\nDuration: One month\, January to Febr
 uary 2027\n\nMore: https://www.kimonosartcenter.com/residency-open-call?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kimonosartcenter.com/residency-open-call?utm_source=artific
 ialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
