 allgemeines/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Residencies in Rome (Villa Massimo\, 10 months)\, Olevano Romano (
 Casa Baldi\, 3 months)\, Venice (Deutsches Studienzentrum\, 3 months) and 
 Paris (6 months). RESTRICTED: German citizenship OR primary residence and 
 artistic practice in Germany.
END:VEVENT
