 rance venue for a creation residency in visual\, digital or urban arts. Th
 e artist receives a bourse of EUR 2\,400 gross per month for 2 to 10 month
 s\, and the venue receives support for its mediation programme around the 
 residency.\n\nOrganisation: Region Ile-de-France\nLocation: Ile-de-France\
 , France. Professional artists affiliated to the French artist social-secu
 rity regime\, applying jointly with an Ile-de-France host venue.\nAward: E
 UR 2\,400 gross per month bourse to the artist for a residency of 2 to 10 
 months\; the programme also funds the host venue's mediation programme. No
