 national artist residencies: established artists live and work in Berlin f
 or a year (six months for film) and become part of the city's cultural sce
 ne. Applications are open in literature\, music and sound\, and film\; vis
 ual arts fellows are nominated by a jury and cannot apply.\n\nOrganisation
 : DAAD Artists-in-Berlin Program (Berliner Kuenstlerprogramm)\nLocation: B
 erlin\, Germany. In person.\nAward: Monthly stipend to cover living expens
 es and rent (amount not published)\, furnished apartment\, and economy tra
 vel and luggage costs (also for partners and children living in Berlin for
  the full fellowship). No application fee.\nDuration: 12 months for litera
 ture and music and sound\; 6 months for film.\n\nMore: https://www.berline
 r-kuenstlerprogramm.de/en/application/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantde
