SUMMARY:Deadline: Arts at CERN: Grand Prix Resonance 2027 (two-month CERN r
 esidency for Geneva-based duos and collectives)
DESCRIPTION:Resonance is Arts at CERN's residency for Geneva-based artists 
 working at the intersection of art\, science and technology. For the 15th 
 anniversary of the Higgs boson discovery\, the 2027 edition is a special G
 rand Prix Resonance: two artists applying as a duo\, or an artist collecti
 ve\, get a fully funded two-month residency at CERN in summer 2027\, with 
 a tailored programme of dialogue with...\n\nOrganisation: Arts at CERN\, w
 ith the City of Geneva and the Republic and Canton of Geneva\nLocation: CE
 RN\, Geneva\, Switzerland. Only for artists domiciled in the Canton of Gen
 eva (collectives: registered office in the canton)\, applying as a duo or 
 collective\, aged 18+.\nAward: CHF 30\,000 grant for research\, developmen
 t and production\, plus a monthly stipend of CHF 5\,000 per artist for a d
 uo or CHF 10\,000 per month for a collective\, for two months\; curatorial
  mentoring. No application fee stated.\nDuration: Two months on site\, Mon
 day to Friday\, summer 2027 (June to July).\n\nMore: https://arts.cern/cal
 l/grand-prix-resonance/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
URL:https://arts.cern/call/grand-prix-resonance/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:CERN\, Geneva\, Switzerland. Only for artists domiciled in the Can
 ton of Geneva (collectives: registered office in the canton)\, applying as
  a duo or collective\, aged 18+.
END:VEVENT
